<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>At every time, in every clime I found</l><l>Those, not with words to Christ, but Spirit bound.</l><l>He strengthens them with might each day, each hour;</l><l>Through them true works divine are wrought in power.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>This is the Church the Spirit hath begot,</l><l>Elect from every people, Christ their lot.</l><l>They follow where His shepherd-staff doth lead;</l><l>The members of this host are blessed indeed.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>And when on earth they meet His death to show,</l><l>To Him their vows of love they oft renew.</l><l>Some little flock will gather there or here;</l><l>Christ, Head of all, to every soul most near.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>This is the temple which our Lord approves,</l><l>The Church which truly honors Him and loves,</l><l>Whose sacrifice is on the altar bound;</l><l>She soon in glory will His throne surround.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
